nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;　　名门望族张佑承隐忍多年，终于举事，归义火种在绝望中点燃。然而敌众我寡，漠州命悬一线，最后的希望落在仓皇出城的小队身上——狼鹞子、诺次、张月牙、曹光宗。 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;　　黄沙之下，埋着六十年前的唐军；壁画深处，藏着无人知晓的秘密。孤勇的旗手、神秘的张都尉、苦守石窟的廖黑云……那些被风沙掩埋的名字将逐一登场，一同回答那个问题：唐旗，还能不能重新飘扬在漠州城头？<\/p>","vod_play_from":"lzm3u8","vod_play_server":"no","vod_play_note":"","vod_play_url":"HD中字$https:\/\/v.lzcdn27.com\/20261029\/20623_4715c227\/index.m3u8","vod_down_from":"http","vod_down_server":"no","vod_down_note":"","vod_down_url":"HD中字$https:\/\/dow.lzdown29.com\/20261029\/20623_4715c227\/敦煌英雄-电影.mp4","vod_plot":0,"vod_plot_name":"","vod_plot_detail":"","type_name":"动作片"},{"vod_id":162989,"type_id":6,"type_id_1":1,"group_id":0,"vod_name":"老江湖","vod_sub":"老警的最后一案 \/ The Old Dog \/ The Old Fox","vod_en":"laojianghu","vod_status":1,"vod_letter":"L","vod_color":"","vod_tag":"","vod_class":"喜剧,动作,犯罪","vod_pic":"https:\/\/p.lztutu.com\/upload\/vod\/20261022-1\/26ae496f4942043f0c33e2c021cb9d2b.webp","vod_pic_thumb":"","vod_pic_slide":"","vod_pic_original":"","vod_pic_thumb_original":null,"vod_pic_screenshot":null,"vod_actor":"于谦,梁家辉,王影璐,段博文,赵小棠,梁天,翟潇闻,张百乔,韩云云,张祐维,郭丞,于晓光,赵阳,谷嘉诚,胡光子","vod_director":"刘誉,李太阁","vod_writer":"刘誉,郑晓阳","vod_behind":"","vod_blurb":"一条命案、一笔巨额欠款、一场做空操盘……全因一起平平无奇却又疑点重重的失窃案而起。即将退休的民警井有正（于谦 饰）发现了蹊跷，随着调查的深入，所有线索都指向明典集团董事长边居寒（梁家辉 饰）。老井锲而","vod_remarks":"HD","vod_pubdate":"2026-09-25(中国大陆)","vod_total":0,"vod_serial":"","vod_tv":"","vod_weekday":"","vod_area":"中国大陆","vod_lang":"汉语普通话","vod_year":"2026","vod_version":"","vod_state":"","vod_author":"","vod_jumpurl":"","vod_tpl":"","vod_tpl_play":"","vod_tpl_down":"","vod_isend":0,"vod_lock":0,"vod_level":0,"vod_copyright":0,"vod_points":0,"vod_points_play":0,"vod_points_down":0,"vod_hits":10806,"vod_hits_day":0,"vod_hits_week":0,"vod_hits_month":0,"vod_duration":"100分钟","